{
  "info": {
    "name": "Storage X Ship — Partner API",
    "description": "Create, track, edit, cancel and label shipments through Storage X Ship — plus checking coverage and getting a price quote before you commit to an order. Works the same way for every partner we integrate with — nothing here is specific to any one merchant.\n\nBefore you run anything: set `baseUrl` and `apiKey` in this collection's Variables tab (or in your own Postman Environment). The correct `baseUrl` for your integration is shown at the top of the full API reference we gave you, under \"Base URL\" — copy it from there rather than guessing.\n\nEvery shipment requires a Saudi National Address short code (four letters + four digits, e.g. RRRD6636) on both the pickup and recipient side — see `recipient.nationalAddress` / `pickup.nationalAddress` on Create.\n\nMoney fields: send amounts in riyals (e.g. `amount: 150`) — that's the default. A halala (SAR's minor unit, 1 SAR = 100 halalas) alternative is always accepted too (`amountMinor: 15000`) if you prefer an integer on your end; sending both, the halala value wins. Everything we send back is always halalas, as a string (e.g. `\"totalMinor\": \"3120\"` = 31.20 SAR) — never a float.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://shipping.3rdmile.net/api/public/partner/v1",
      "description": "Your live production base URL, confirmed reachable."
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_API_KEY",
      "description": "The partner API key issued to you by Storage X Ship. Sent as Authorization: Bearer <apiKey> on every request. Keep it out of anything you commit or share."
    },
    {
      "key": "trackingNumber",
      "value": "SXS10394822",
      "description": "Set this from a real Create response, then Track/Update/Cancel/Label all reuse it."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Coverage",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List all covered cities",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "coverage"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every currently serviceable city, all at once. No query parameters means no pagination — `pagination` comes back null."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "coverage"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"cities\": [\n    { \"city\": \"Riyadh\", \"cityAr\": \"الرياض\", \"pickupAvailable\": true, \"deliveryAvailable\": true, \"viaOwnFleet\": true },\n    { \"city\": \"Jeddah\", \"cityAr\": \"جدة\", \"pickupAvailable\": true, \"deliveryAvailable\": true, \"viaOwnFleet\": false }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": null\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Search + paginate",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage?q=jed&page=1&pageSize=25",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "coverage"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "jed",
                  "description": "Matches city name, English or Arabic script. Optional."
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "1-based. Requires pageSize to also be set."
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "25",
                  "description": "Rows per page, capped at 200. Setting this turns paging on."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filtered and paginated. Omit q to list every covered city; omit page/pageSize to get everything unpaginated."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - paginated",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage?q=jed&page=1&pageSize=25",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "coverage"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "q",
                      "value": "jed"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "page",
                      "value": "1"
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "pageSize",
                      "value": "25"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"cities\": [\n    { \"city\": \"Jeddah\", \"cityAr\": \"جدة\", \"pickupAvailable\": true, \"deliveryAvailable\": true, \"viaOwnFleet\": false }\n  ],\n  \"pagination\": { \"page\": 1, \"pageSize\": 25, \"total\": 1, \"totalPages\": 1 }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request - page without pageSize",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage?page=2",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "coverage"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "page",
                      "value": "2"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{ \"error\": \"missing_page_size\", \"message\": \"page requires pageSize to also be set\" }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "One city's detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage?city=Riyadh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "coverage"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "city",
                  "value": "Riyadh",
                  "description": "Loosely matched — common aliases resolve to the right city."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "One city plus any district breakdown on file for it. Takes priority over q/page/pageSize if both are somehow sent."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage?city=Riyadh",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "coverage"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "city",
                      "value": "Riyadh"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"city\": \"Riyadh\",\n  \"cityAr\": \"الرياض\",\n  \"pickupAvailable\": true,\n  \"deliveryAvailable\": true,\n  \"viaOwnFleet\": true,\n  \"districts\": []\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Not Found",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/coverage?city=Nowhereville",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "coverage"
                  ],
                  "query": [
                    {
                      "key": "city",
                      "value": "Nowhereville"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{ \"error\": \"city_not_found\", \"message\": \"no coverage data for \\\"Nowhereville\\\"\" }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pricing",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get a quote",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/quote",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "quote"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"recipient\": { \"city\": \"Riyadh\" },\n  \"pickup\": { \"city\": \"Jeddah\" },\n  \"package\": { \"weightGrams\": 900 },\n  \"cod\": { \"amount\": 150, \"method\": \"cash\" }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Same nested shape as Create, minus the fields pricing has no use for. Uses the exact pricing engine Create itself uses — never a separate estimate that could drift from what you're actually charged. cod.amount is in riyals; cod.amountMinor (halalas) is also accepted if you prefer an integer."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - serviceable",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/quote",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "quote"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"serviceable\": true,\n  \"baseMinor\": \"2500\",\n  \"additionalUnits\": 0,\n  \"weightMinor\": \"0\",\n  \"fuelBp\": 250,\n  \"fuelMinor\": \"63\",\n  \"codFeeMinor\": \"150\",\n  \"netMinor\": \"2713\",\n  \"vatMinor\": \"407\",\n  \"totalMinor\": \"3120\",\n  \"returnFeeMinor\": \"500\",\n  \"notes\": []\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK - not serviceable",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/quote",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "quote"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{ \"serviceable\": false }"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request - missing weight",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/quote",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "quote"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{ \"error\": \"missing_weight\", \"message\": \"package.weightGrams is required and must be positive\" }"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Shipments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shipments",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "shipments"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"externalOrderId\": \"ORD-48213\",\n  \"recipient\": {\n    \"name\": \"Sara Al-Otaibi\",\n    \"phone\": \"0551234567\",\n    \"addressLine\": \"Prince Sultan Rd, Bldg 12\",\n    \"nationalAddress\": \"RRRD6636\",\n    \"city\": \"Riyadh\",\n    \"district\": \"Al Olaya\"\n  },\n  \"pickup\": {\n    \"phone\": \"0559876543\",\n    \"addressLine\": \"King Fahd Rd, Warehouse 3\",\n    \"nationalAddress\": \"ABCD1234\",\n    \"city\": \"Riyadh\"\n  },\n  \"package\": {\n    \"weightGrams\": 900,\n    \"pieces\": 1,\n    \"description\": \"Shoes\"\n  },\n  \"cod\": { \"amount\": 150, \"method\": \"cash\" }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "externalOrderId is your idempotency key — retry the same call safely and you get the same shipment back with duplicate: true instead of a second parcel. recipient/pickup nationalAddress are required: four letters + four digits, e.g. RRRD6636. cod.amount is in riyals; cod.amountMinor (halalas) also accepted."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shipments",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "shipments"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"shipmentId\": \"b6e2c9d4-1a2b-4c3d-9e8f-0123456789ab\",\n  \"trackingNumber\": \"SXS10394822\",\n  \"status\": \"awaiting_pickup\",\n  \"externalOrderId\": \"ORD-48213\",\n  \"duplicate\": false\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK - retried (duplicate)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/shipments",
                  "host": [
